WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
The four-button target ender leaves Ryu knocked down.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.450
Kimberly uses the two-dash approach.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.000
Standing heavy kick hits the waking Ryu.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Standing heavy punch links after the wake-up heavy kick.

5
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.200
Heavy Vagabond Edge launches Ryu.

6
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.500
The air grab converts the launch.

7
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.500
The heavy-kick branch ends in a hard knockdown.
